[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    580[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    581[0m:[38;5;10m[49m /// A small xorshift* PRNG: no dev-dependencies needed, and fully reproducible.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    582[0m:[38;5;10m[49m struct Lcg(u64);
